## Speed

With gcc \f$14.2\f$ and RTX \f$4070\f$ SUPER CUDA, forward calls take \f$264\f$ ns single-thread (\f$193\f$ ns own elementary), \f$17.9\f$ ns CUDA, and \f$< 5\,\mu\mathrm{s}\f$ in Temme's band. Inverses average \f$1.3\f$ forward calls: \f$685\f$–\f$798\f$ ns (\f$433\f$–\f$485\f$ ns own) single-thread, \f$20\f$–\f$83\f$ ns CUDA. Across orders \f$1\f$–\f$6\f$, shape takes \f$534\f$–\f$1473\f$ ns (\f$105\f$–\f$148\f$ ns OpenMP-\f$8\f$; \f$125\f$–\f$195\f$ ns CUDA, orders \f$1\f$–\f$5\f$); mixed \f$1197\f$–\f$4372\f$ ns (\f$160\f$–\f$621\f$ ns OpenMP-\f$8\f$); ratio \f$1689\f$–\f$5345\f$ ns (\f$227\f$–\f$737\f$ ns OpenMP-\f$8\f$).

## Example

This Kokkos kernel evaluates all five headers.

\code{.cpp}
#include <laplace/math/incomplete_gamma.hpp>
#include <laplace/math/incomplete_gamma_deriv.hpp>
#include <laplace/math/incomplete_gamma_mixed.hpp>
#include <laplace/math/incomplete_gamma_ratio.hpp>
#include <laplace/math/incomplete_inverse.hpp>
#include <Kokkos_Core.hpp>

void eval_gamma(Kokkos::View<const double*> a, Kokkos::View<const double*> x,
                Kokkos::View<double*> lp, Kokkos::View<double*> da,
                Kokkos::View<double*> dx, Kokkos::View<double*> dc,
                Kokkos::View<double*> xi, int n) {
  Kokkos::parallel_for("gamma", n, KOKKOS_LAMBDA(int i) {
    double av = a(i), xv = x(i), p = laplace::math::gamma_p(av, xv);
    lp(i) = laplace::math::log_gamma_p(av, xv);
    da(i) = laplace::math::log_gamma_p_da1(av, xv);
    dx(i) = laplace::math::log_gamma_p_mixed_d1(av, xv).v[1];
    dc(i) = laplace::math::log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d1(av, xv / av).v[0];
    xi(i) = laplace::math::gamma_p_inv(av, p);
  });
}
\endcode

## Module functions

Called as `laplace::math::NAME`.

### Result types and forward functions

- \ref laplace::math::own::gamma_inc_result "gamma_inc_result" — Values \f$P, Q\f$, logs, and low-order parts
- \ref laplace::math::gamma_inc_mixed_partials "gamma_inc_mixed_partials" — Order-\f$K\f$ mixed partials array
- \ref laplace::math::own::gamma_inc "gamma_inc()" — Joint \f$P, Q\f$ and logs
- \ref laplace::math::own::gamma_p "gamma_p()", \ref laplace::math::own::gamma_q "gamma_q()" — Regularized incomplete gamma functions
- \ref laplace::math::log_gamma_p "log_gamma_p()", \ref laplace::math::log_gamma_q "log_gamma_q()" — \f$\log P\f$ and \f$\log Q\f$

### Shape derivatives

- Lower 1–6: \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_da1 "log_gamma_p_da1()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_da2 "log_gamma_p_da2()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_da3 "log_gamma_p_da3()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_da4 "log_gamma_p_da4()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_da5 "log_gamma_p_da5()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_da6 "log_gamma_p_da6()"
- Upper 1–6: \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_da1 "log_gamma_q_da1()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_da2 "log_gamma_q_da2()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_da3 "log_gamma_q_da3()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_da4 "log_gamma_q_da4()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_da5 "log_gamma_q_da5()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_da6 "log_gamma_q_da6()"

### Mixed partial derivatives

- Lower 1–6: \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_mixed_d1 "log_gamma_p_mixed_d1()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_mixed_d2 "log_gamma_p_mixed_d2()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_mixed_d3 "log_gamma_p_mixed_d3()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_mixed_d4 "log_gamma_p_mixed_d4()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_mixed_d5 "log_gamma_p_mixed_d5()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_mixed_d6 "log_gamma_p_mixed_d6()"
- Upper 1–6: \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_mixed_d1 "log_gamma_q_mixed_d1()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_mixed_d2 "log_gamma_q_mixed_d2()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_mixed_d3 "log_gamma_q_mixed_d3()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_mixed_d4 "log_gamma_q_mixed_d4()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_mixed_d5 "log_gamma_q_mixed_d5()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_mixed_d6 "log_gamma_q_mixed_d6()"

### Partial derivatives at fixed ratio

- Lower 1–6: \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d1 "log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d1()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d2 "log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d2()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d3 "log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d3()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d4 "log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d4()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d5 "log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d5()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d6 "log_gamma_p_ratio_mixed_d6()"
- Upper 1–6: \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d1 "log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d1()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d2 "log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d2()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d3 "log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d3()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d4 "log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d4()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d5 "log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d5()", \ref laplace::math::own::log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d6 "log_gamma_q_ratio_mixed_d6()"

### Inverse functions

- \ref laplace::math::own::gamma_p_inv "gamma_p_inv()", \ref laplace::math::own::gamma_q_inv "gamma_q_inv()" — Solve \f$P = p\f$, \f$Q = q\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::gamma_p_inv_logp "gamma_p_inv_logp()", \ref laplace::math::own::gamma_q_inv_logq "gamma_q_inv_logq()" — Solve \f$\log P = \log p\f$, \f$\log Q = \log q\f$

